          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(C)　最初に定義域を固定する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "底が正で1ではなく、真数も正である条件を先にまとめます。真数条件から \\(0<x<9/2\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "対数の和を1つへまとめ、底が2より大きいことを使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1+\\log_2\\{x(9-2x)\\}<3 \\iff (x-4)(2x-1)>0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "0<x<\\frac12,\\qquad 4<x<\\frac92",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(D)　長さの2乗を展開する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "25=16+3+2\\vec a\\cdot\\vec b \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad \\vec a\\cdot\\vec b=3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "|\\vec a+t\\vec b|^2=16+6t+3t^2=3(t+1)^2+13",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "よって \\(t=-1\\) のとき最小値は \\(\\sqrt{13}\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(E)　双曲線を標準形にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(y^2/12-x^2/8=1\\) なので焦点は \\((0,\\pm2\\sqrt3)\\) です。元の式を陰関数微分して指定点の傾きを求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}x+\\sqrt6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　中点軌跡と面積（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "アイ −4／ウ 1"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "エオ −4／カ 2／キ 1／クケ −4／コ 2／サシ −4／ス 3／セ 5／ソタ −4／チ 2／ツ 3／テ 5／ト 9／ナ 2"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "最初の一手",
            "text": "点を媒介変数で表し、中点座標から媒介変数を消去します。(2)では正方形の4辺を別々に処理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　AとPの中点",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(P=(t,-2t^2-1)\\) と置きます。Aは \\((0,3)\\) なので中点は \\((t/2,1-t^2)\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac t2 \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad y=-4x^2+1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　接線を媒介変数tで表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=-4tx+2t^2-1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "接線上のQと周上のRの中点を \\(M=(s,y)\\) とします。RがBC上のときとAB上のときを、解と係数の関係で整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M=(s,-4s^2-2)\\quad(1\\le s\\le3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M=(s,-4s^2+3s-5)\\quad(0\\le s\\le1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "同じ処理をAD上とCD上へ続けます。CD上では横座標が一定なので縦の線分になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "M=\\left(s,-4s^2+\\frac23s-5\\right)\\quad(0\\le s\\le3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=3,\\qquad -39\\le y\\le-38",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "面積の作り方",
            "text": "同じxに対する上側と下側のyの差を、境界が切り替わる区間ごとに積分します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac92",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-locus",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　正六角形上の確率移動（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 4／イ 9"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）",
                "value": "ウエ 13／オカ 27／キク 12／ケコ 13"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（i）",
                "value": "サ 4／シ 9／ス ②"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）（ii）",
                "value": "p₃₍ₘ₊₁₎=−p₃ₘ/27+14/27、p₃ₘ={(-1/27)^m+1}/2"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "記号を固定",
            "text": "時計回りに2頂点進む動きをT（確率1/3）、反時計回りに1頂点進む動きをH（確率2/3）とします。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　2回後にF",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Fに着く並びはTHとHTの2通りです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2\\cdot\\frac13\\cdot\\frac23=\\frac49",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)　3回後にA",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Aに着くのはHHT、HTH、THH、TTTです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3\\left(\\frac23\\right)^2\\frac13+\\left(\\frac13\\right)^3=\\frac{13}{27}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "このうち途中でDを通らない経路の確率を分子に置くと、条件付き確率は \\(12/13\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(i)　3回を1ブロックとみる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "3回でAへ戻り途中でDを通らない確率も、最後の3回で初めてDへ移る確率も \\(4/9\\) です。前者を \\(l-1\\) 回、後者を1回続けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac49\\right)^{l-1}\\frac49=\\left(\\frac49\\right)^l",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)(ii)　3回ごとの漸化式",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "3m回後にDにいる場合といない場合へ分け、次の3回後にDへ着く確率を足します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_{3(m+1)}=\\frac{13}{27}p_{3m}+\\frac{14}{27}(1-p_{3m})=-\\frac1{27}p_{3m}+\\frac{14}{27}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "定常値1/2を引けば公比−1/27の等比数列になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "p_{3m}=\\frac12\\left\\{\\left(-\\frac1{27}\\right)^m+1\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　絶対値を含む定積分（学習者向け解説）",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "（1）",
                "value": "ア 1／イ 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）（i）",
                "value": "ウ 1／エ 2／オ 1"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）（ii）",
                "value": "カ 1／キ 1／ク 1／ケ 1／コ 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（2）（iii）",
                "value": "サ 1／シ 3／セ 3／ス 1／ソ 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "（3）",
                "value": "タ 1／チ 2／ツ 1／テ 3／ト 3"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1)　x=0を代入",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(0)=\\int_0^{\\pi/4}\\sin2t\\,dt=\\frac12",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q4-triangle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(i)　x≤0では絶対値内が非負",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\frac12(1-x)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(ii)　x>0では符号の変わる点を置く",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(\\tan2\\alpha=x\\) を満たす \\(\\alpha\\) で絶対値内の符号が変わります。直角三角形から正弦と余弦をxで表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos2\\alpha=\\frac1{\\sqrt{x^2+1}},\\qquad \\sin2\\alpha=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0からαとαからπ/4に分け、後半では符号を反転して積分します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(x)=\\sqrt{x^2+1}-\\frac12(x+1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2)(iii)　微分して最小値を探す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f'(x)=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}-\\frac12",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(f'(x)=0\\) から \\(x=1/\\sqrt3\\) です。x≤0の式とも比較すると、これが全域での最小点です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\min f(x)=\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3)　無理関数を置換積分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "積分区間はx≥0なので(2)(ii)の式を使います。無理式とxをまとめる置換を選びます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "u=\\sqrt{x^2+1}+x,\\qquad x=\\frac{u^2-1}{2u},\\qquad dx=\\frac{u^2+1}{2u^2}du",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "端点 \\(x=0,\\sqrt3\\) は \\(u=1,2+\\sqrt3\\) に対応します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "international-health-welfare-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "置換後の有理式を積分し、端点を代入します。\\(\\log(2+\\sqrt3)=2\\log(1+\\sqrt3)\\) を使って整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}f(x)\\,dx=\\frac12\\left\\{\\log(1+\\sqrt3)+\\sqrt3\\right\\}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "結論",
            "text": "タ=1、チ=2、ツ=1、テ=3、ト=3です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
